###

# 0C. Create sample data for testing (chỉ dùng nếu không có data gì)
POST https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/test/create-sample-data
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 2. DEBUG: Kiểm tra raw data từ database (nếu step 0 thành công nhưng GET vẫn empty)
GET https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/debug/raw-items
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 3. Get main newsfeed (with enhanced debugging) - SẼ CÓ DATA SAU KHI FIX
GET https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed?page=0&size=20&sortBy=priority
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 3. Get unseen newsfeed
GET https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/unseen?page=0&size=50
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 4. Get newsfeed by type (posts only)
GET https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/type/POST?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 5. Get recent newsfeed (last 24 hours)
GET https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/recent?page=0&size=30
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 6. Mark items as seen
POST https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/mark-seen
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]

###

# 7. Mark item as interacted
POST https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/items/1/interact
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 8. Get unseen count
GET https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/unseen-count
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 9. Get feed analytics
GET https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/analytics
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 10. Get popular content
GET https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/popular?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 11. Get trending topics
GET https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/trending-topics
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 12. Refresh newsfeed
POST https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/refresh
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 13. Clear cache (for testing)
DELETE https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/cache
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 14. Update priority scores
POST https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/update-priorities
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token

###

# 15. ADMIN: Dọn dẹp friendship items (để chỉ giữ posts - tăng performance)
POST https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/admin/cleanup-friendship-items
Authorization: Bearer admin-jwt-token

###

# 16. ADMIN: Populate NewsFeed cho TẤT CẢ users (one-time migration)
POST https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/admin/populate-all-users
Authorization: Bearer admin-jwt-token
